	<string>Indigen World uses the camera so you can take a photo or record a reel for a community post.</string>
	<key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Indigen World uses the microphone to record sound with the reels you post to the community.</string>
	<key>NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Indigen World needs access to your photos so you can attach them to community posts and set your profile picture.</string>
	<key>NSPhotoLibraryAddUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Indigen World saves community media you choose to keep to your photo library.</string>
